(44,	1,	'2026-03-13 22:22:30',	'2026-03-13 22:22:30',	'The original 740 returns from the archives. The 740 combines familiar elements of 2000s running-inspiration – an open knit mesh upper, segmented midsole, and a streamlined silhouette – with flourishes like two-tone color mesh and angular overlays.',	'740',	'The original 740 was the kind of daily runner that would be worn into the ground with heavy miles and bought all over again. This longtime fan favorite returns from the archives.',	'trash',	'open',	'closed',	'',	'740__trashed',	'',	'',	'2026-04-22 17:35:56',	'2026-04-22 17:35:56',	'',	0,	'http://elena.local/product/740/',	0,	'product',	'',	0),
