(182,	1,	'2026-04-22 16:44:46',	'2026-04-22 16:44:46',	'The reissued 1000 brings a turn of the millennium classic out of the archives. Originally released in 1999, the 1000 embodied the era’s bold, futuristic styling with a streamlined, yet intricately detailed design. The standard mesh upper and suede overlay design is inverted, with mesh underlays, emerging from the more prominent overlay panels, for a refined, tech-inspired look. A segmented sole unit features ABZORB cushioning at the heel and forefoot, with a Stability Web midfoot shank.',	'New Balance 1000– Pink / Grey',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'closed',	'',	'new-balance-1000-pink-grey',	'',	'',	'2026-04-23 16:38:01',	'2026-04-23 16:38:01',	'',	0,	'http://elena.local/?post_type=product&#038;p=182',	0,	'product',	'',	0),
